            %p
              Often we will tacitly assume to work over
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%E2%88%9EGrpd"} ∞Grpd
              %a{:href => "#InternalDefinition"} internal definition
              of cohesion, it takes more to fix the base topos than to leave it arbitrary.
            %p
              Every
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/adjoint+quadruple"} adjoint quadruple
              induces an
