                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/effective+epimorphism+in+an+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-category"} effective epimorphism in an (∞,1)-category
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/epimorphism"} epimorphism
              on
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/connected"} connected
              components.
          %p
            Here the first morphismism is the image under
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi Γ
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Gamma
            of the
            = succeed "-" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
