            %h6#proof_10 Proof
            %p
              This follows by the general reasoning discussed at
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/reflective+factorization+system"} reflective factorization system
            %p
              By prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#FactorizationPiEquivalencePiClosed"}
              we have the required factorization. It remains to check the orthogonality.
            %p So let
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mrow
